; Event layout (2026-10-01, after Our Adventurer Guild and Slay the Spire): the scene's prose, then
; the options, each with its chance at a glance ("Elara 55%" or "No roll"). Only the selected
; option opens below: its check, who tries (best first, already picked) and what each degree does.
; Attempt, or the selected option pressed again, commits. Where a bonus comes from is in hovers.

